#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus Insights #256: What is Floci?"
msgstr "Quarkus Insights 第256期：什么是 Floci？"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This summary was generated using AI, reviewed by humans - https://youtube.com/live/VFYZUZbjzd4[watch the video] for the full story."
msgstr "本摘要由人工智能生成，并经人工审核—— link:https://youtube.com/live/VFYZUZbjzd4[请观看视频] 了解完整内容。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Hector Ventura, a Lead Software Engineer with nearly 18 years of Java experience and eight years working day-to-day with AWS, is the creator of https://floci.io[Floci] — a free, open-source suite of local cloud emulators built on top of Quarkus native image. In episode 256 he joins the show to walk through what local cloud emulation actually means, give a live tour of the UI, and explain how a part-time side project opened a week before LocalStack archived its community edition became one of the more talked-about tools in the Quarkus ecosystem."
msgstr "赫克托·文图拉（Hector Ventura）是一名首席软件工程师，拥有近18年的Java开发经验和8年日常使用AWS的经验， link:https://floci.io[他是Floci的] 创建者——这是一款基于Quarkus原生映像构建的免费开源本地云模拟器套件。 在第256期节目中，他做客节目，详细讲解了“本地云模拟”的实际含义，现场演示了用户界面，并阐述了这个在LocalStack存档其社区版前一周启动的兼职副业项目，如何一跃成为Quarkus生态系统中备受热议的工具之一。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Where the Name Comes From"
msgstr "名称的由来"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The name Floci is a play on _cirrocumulus floccus_ — the small, popcorn-shaped cloud formation. Hector's first instinct for the name was \"Floccus\" directly, but it didn't feel right, so \"Floci\" emerged as the working name and stuck. The pronunciation caused some confusion in the episode preview the week before (the hosts attempted roughly six incorrect versions), but it is now firmly settled."
msgstr "“Floci”这个名字是源自 _“cirrocumulus floccus”_ （卷积云）的谐音——这是一种形似爆米花的小型云团。赫克托最初想直接取名为“Floccus”，但感觉不太对劲，于是“Floci”便作为暂定名称出现并沿用至今。 在上周的剧集预告中，这个名字的发音曾引起一些混淆（主持人大概试了六种错误的读法），但现在已经确定下来了。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "(In case you're https://github.com/orgs/floci-io/discussions/815[also unsure], saying \"flossy\" will get you pretty close to what Hector uses.)"
msgstr "（如果你 link:https://github.com/orgs/floci-io/discussions/815[也不确定的] 话，说“flossy”就差不多能表达赫克托用的那个词的意思了。）"

#, fuzzy
msgid "What Floci Is — and What It Is Not"
msgstr "什么是Floci——以及它不是什么"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Hector draws a clear line between three categories that are often conflated:"
msgstr "赫克托尔对三个常被混为一谈的类别划出了明确的界限："

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Mocking** — you define a canned response: \"when you receive _this_, reply with _that_.\" Nothing is actually executed or stored."
msgstr "*模拟* ——你定义一个预设的响应：“收到 _这条消息_ 时，请回复 _那条_ 。”实际上没有任何操作会被执行或存储。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Simulation** — behaviour is pre-defined and the responses are realistic, but they are not based on real state."
msgstr "*仿真* ——行为是预先定义的，响应结果逼真，但并非基于实际状态。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Emulation** — the system behaves like the real thing. If you store an object and ask for it back, Floci returns the object you stored."
msgstr "*模拟* ——系统表现得就像真实对象一样。如果你存储了一个对象并请求取回，Floci 会返回你存储的那个对象。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Floci is firmly in the emulation category. Although its behaviour is realistic, Hector emphasized that it is not intended to replace a real cloud account in production — its purpose is local development, CI/CD pipelines, and AI agent sandboxing, where fast, isolated, and disposable environments matter far more than billing-grade fidelity."
msgstr "Floci 明确属于仿真类别。尽管其行为表现非常逼真，但赫克托强调，它并非旨在取代生产环境中的真实云账户——其用途是本地开发、CI/CD 管道以及 AI 代理沙箱测试，在这些场景中，快速、隔离且可抛弃的环境远比计费级别的保真度更为重要。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "A Suite, Not Just an AWS Clone"
msgstr "一套完整的解决方案，而不仅仅是 AWS 的克隆版"

#, fuzzy
msgid "At launch Floci was a single AWS emulator. Today it covers AWS, Azure, https://cloud.google.com[Google Cloud Platform], and https://www.oracle.com/cloud/[Oracle OCI] — each running in its own container on its own port, with a consistent CLI and UI experience across all four. The project launched as open source on March 15, a week before LocalStack archived its community edition. Five months in, the volume of incoming issues and pull requests already makes the project feel much older than it is."
msgstr "Floci 最初发布时仅是一个 AWS 模拟器。如今，它已支持 AWS、Azure、 link:https://cloud.google.com[Google Cloud Platform] 和 link:https://www.oracle.com/cloud/[Oracle OCI——] 每个 link:https://www.oracle.com/cloud/[平台] 都在独立的容器中通过独立端口运行，且这四个平台均提供一致的命令行界面（CLI）和用户界面（UI）体验。该项目于 3 月 15 日以开源形式发布，此时距离 LocalStack 存档其社区版仅有一周时间。 上线仅五个月，涌入的问题和拉取请求的数量之多，已让该项目显得比实际年龄要成熟得多。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "How It Works Under the Hood"
msgstr "幕后原理"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For most services Floci implements the cloud provider APIs directly. For services where a from-scratch implementation would take years — databases like AWS RDS being the primary example — Floci uses the same strategy the clouds themselves use: it spins up a real Docker container running PostgreSQL, MySQL, or MariaDB. Lambda is handled similarly: Floci pulls the official AWS Lambda runtime images from the ECR and executes function code inside them, giving near-identical behaviour to a real Lambda invocation."
msgstr "对于大多数服务，Floci 会直接调用云服务商的 API。对于那些从头开始实现需要数年时间的服务——以 AWS RDS 等数据库为主要例子——Floci 采用了云服务商自身所使用的策略：它会启动一个运行 PostgreSQL、MySQL 或 MariaDB 的真实 Docker 容器。 Lambda 的处理方式类似：Floci 从 ECR 中拉取官方的 AWS Lambda 运行时镜像，并在其中执行函数代码，从而实现与实际 Lambda 调用几乎完全相同的行为。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The entire emulator is compiled to a https://www.graalvm.org[GraalVM] native image via Quarkus, which is what produces the headline numbers the community keeps sharing: **24 ms startup time and 13 MB idle memory**."
msgstr "整个模拟器通过 Quarkus 编译为 link:https://www.graalvm.org[GraalVM] 本机映像，这也正是社区不断分享的那些令人瞩目的数据来源： *24 毫秒的启动时间和 13 MB 的空闲内存* 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus Dev Services Integration"
msgstr "Quarkus 开发服务集成"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus Dev Services originally wired local AWS emulation through https://www.localstack.cloud[LocalStack] via https://testcontainers.com[Testcontainers]. The same mechanism — which talks to the Docker socket to start a pre-configured container — now supports multiple providers, and Floci is one of them. Switching is a configuration change; no application code has to change because your code still talks to the original AWS, Azure, or GCP SDK."
msgstr "Quarkus Dev Services 最初是通过 link:https://testcontainers.com[Testcontainers] 借助 link:https://www.localstack.cloud[LocalStack] 实现本地 AWS 模拟的。该机制——即通过与 Docker 套接字通信来启动预配置的容器——现已支持多个提供商，Floci 便是其中之一。 切换仅需修改配置；由于您的代码仍与原有的 AWS、Azure 或 GCP SDK 进行通信，因此无需修改任何应用程序代码。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The UI and Storage Modes"
msgstr "用户界面和存储模式"

#, fuzzy
msgid "A live demo showed Floci's built-in status page at `localhost:4566`, which lists running services and exposes a button to launch the https://github.com/floci-io/floci-ui[Floci UI] as a separate container on port 4500. The UI is deliberately not embedded in the emulator itself — Floci is used heavily in CI/CD and by AI agents, where no UI is needed and keeping the image lean matters."
msgstr "现场演示展示了 Floci 内置的状态页面（位于 `localhost:4566` ），该页面列出了正在运行的服务，并提供了一个按钮，用于在 4500 端口上以独立容器形式启动 link:https://github.com/floci-io/floci-ui[Floci 用户界面] 。 该用户界面是刻意未嵌入到模拟器本身中的——Floci 主要应用于 CI/CD 以及 AI 代理场景，这些场景既不需要用户界面，保持镜像精简也至关重要。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The UI uses a cloud-agnostic vocabulary (Storage rather than S3, for example) so it can represent all four providers in the same pane. \"Coming soon\" labels throughout map the intended roadmap in a form far more visible than a GitHub issue list."
msgstr "该用户界面采用了一种与云服务无关的术语（例如使用“存储”而非“S3”），因此可以在同一个面板中展示所有四家服务提供商。界面中随处可见的“即将推出”标签，以比 GitHub 问题列表更直观的方式展示了预期的路线图。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "For data persistence Floci offers four storage modes:"
msgstr "在数据持久化方面，Floci 提供了四种存储模式："

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Memory** — fastest; data is lost when the container stops. Good for AI agent sandboxing."
msgstr "*内存* — 速度最快；容器停止时数据会丢失。适用于人工智能代理的沙箱环境。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Persisted** — every write goes to disk immediately. Deterministic and source-controllable for test fixture data."
msgstr "*持久化* ——每次写入都会立即写入磁盘。对于测试 fixture 数据，具有确定性且可通过源代码进行控制。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Hybrid** — writes go to memory and are flushed to disk asynchronously, inspired by PostgreSQL's write-ahead log. Faster than persisted, still recoverable after a restart."
msgstr "*混合模式* ——写入操作先存入内存，随后异步刷新到磁盘，其设计灵感源自 PostgreSQL 的预写日志（WAL）。比持久化模式更快，且重启后仍可恢复。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Write-ahead-logging completes the set and is tailored for write-heavy workloads."
msgstr "预写日志功能完善了这一套件，专为写入密集型工作负载而设计。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Hector pointed out that persistence was a first-class design goal from day one, because the LocalStack community edition could not reliably copy or move a persistent dataset — a limitation that drove him to build something different."
msgstr "赫克托指出，持久性从一开始就是首要的设计目标，因为 LocalStack 社区版无法可靠地复制或移动持久化数据集——正是这一限制促使他开发出了全新的解决方案。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "AI Agent Sandboxing"
msgstr "AI 代理沙箱环境"

#, fuzzy
msgid "One use case that surfaced briefly on screen stood out: the ability to assign a separate Floci instance to each AI agent running in parallel. A company that reached out to Hector described how spinning up isolated Floci environments per agent had materially accelerated their development process. With no real cloud credentials in play and data that simply disappears at the end of a session, it removes the category of horror stories that arise from giving an LLM access to a live account with real billing."
msgstr "屏幕上短暂闪现的一个用例尤为引人注目：能够为每个并行运行的AI代理分配一个独立的Floci实例。 一家联系过赫克托的公司描述道，为每个代理单独部署隔离的 Floci 环境，显著加快了他们的开发进程。由于无需使用真实的云服务凭证，且数据会在会话结束时自动消失，这彻底消除了因让大型语言模型（LLM）访问带有真实计费功能的实时账户而引发的各种“噩梦”式事件。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "AWS SDK Compatibility and Versioning"
msgstr "AWS SDK 的兼容性与版本管理"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Hector addressed how Floci tracks SDK evolution: AWS SDKs maintain backwards compatibility, so new service versions add capability without breaking existing calls. AWS is working on an interface definition format called https://github.com/awslabs/smithy[Smithy]; GCP and OCI are cleaner because they publish https://grpc.io[gRPC] Protobuf definitions that Floci uses directly — the same `.proto` files the SDKs themselves are generated from."
msgstr "Hector 介绍了 Floci 如何追踪 SDK 的演进：AWS SDK 保持向后兼容性，因此新服务版本在添加功能的同时不会破坏现有调用。 AWS 正在开发一种名为 link:https://github.com/awslabs/smithy[Smithy] 的接口定义格式；而 GCP 和 OCI 的实现更为简洁，因为它们发布了 link:https://grpc.io[gRPC] Protobuf 定义，Floci 可以直接使用这些定义——这些正是 SDK 自身生成所依据的 `.proto` 文件。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Using AWS CLI with Floci"
msgstr "在 Floci 中使用 AWS CLI"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The demo walked through redirecting the AWS CLI at a local Floci instance. The key points:"
msgstr "该演示详细介绍了如何将 AWS CLI 重定向到本地 Floci 实例。要点如下："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Export the `AWS_ENDPOINT_URL` environment variable to point at `localhost:4566`."
msgstr "将 `AWS_ENDPOINT_URL` 环境变量导出，使其指向 `localhost:4566` 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Use placeholder credentials — Floci does not validate them."
msgstr "使用占位符凭据——Floci 不会对其进行验证。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Floci registers `*.floci.io` as a DNS alias for `127.0.0.1`, so SDK path-style and virtual-hosted-style S3 URLs both resolve locally without editing `/etc/hosts`."
msgstr "Floci 将 `*.floci.io` 注册为 `127.0.0.1` 的 DNS 别名，因此无论采用 SDK 路径风格还是虚拟主机风格的 S3 URL，均可在无需修改 `/etc/hosts 文件` 的情况下在本地解析。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Once those three things are in place, `aws s3 ls` and `aws s3 mb` work exactly as they would against a real account."
msgstr "一旦这三项条件都具备， ``aws s3 ls` ` 和 ``aws s3 mb` ` 的运行方式就与针对真实账户时完全一致。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "What&#8217;s Next"
msgstr "接下来会发生什么"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Hector named three priorities:"
msgstr "赫克托列举了三项优先事项："

#, fuzzy
msgid "**More maintainers.** Pull requests are growing faster than the current team can review them carefully by hand. He emphasized that even with AI assistance, every PR needs a human pass."
msgstr "*需要更多维护者。* 拉取请求的增长速度已经超过了当前团队手动仔细审核的能力。他强调，即使有人工智能的辅助，每个拉取请求仍需人工审核。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**CloudFormation expansion.** CloudFormation support exists today but is the single most-requested feature for expansion, pushing Floci further into the infrastructure-as-code and DevOps workflows."
msgstr "*CloudFormation 功能扩展。* 目前虽然已支持 CloudFormation，但这是用户呼声最高的功能扩展需求，将推动 Floci 进一步融入“基础设施即代码”和 DevOps 工作流。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Floci Pods.** A planned feature that would produce a small, portable artifact — current working title \"Snapshot\" — encapsulating a complete Floci environment state so that a developer can send a colleague a reproducible bug reproduction with the exact data that triggered it. Suggestions for names are still welcome on the https://github.com/orgs/floci-io/discussions/1783[state artifact naming poll]."
msgstr "*Floci Pods。* 这是一项计划中的功能，将生成一个小型、便携的 artifacts（当前暂定名为“Snapshot”），其中封装了完整的 Floci 环境状态，以便开发者能够向同事发送可复现的 bug 重现环境，其中包含触发该 bug 的确切数据。 关于该 link:https://github.com/orgs/floci-io/discussions/1783[状态工件] 的命名，我们仍在 link:https://github.com/orgs/floci-io/discussions/1783[“状态工件命名投票] ”中欢迎大家提出建议。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The release cadence is settling into two releases per emulator per month (first and third Tuesday), down from the early pace of a release every three or four days that was burning maintainer time."
msgstr "发布频率已稳定在每个模拟器每月两次（每月的第一和第三个星期二），这比早期每三到四天发布一次的节奏有所放缓，此前那种高频发布曾耗费了维护人员大量时间。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Key Takeaways"
msgstr "要点总结"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Emulation vs mocking** — Floci stores and returns real data; it is not injecting pre-baked responses."
msgstr "*模拟与模拟对象的区别* ——Floci 存储并返回真实数据；它不会注入预先准备好的响应。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Multi-cloud from day one** — AWS, Azure, GCP, and OCI are all represented, with coverage expanding on community demand."
msgstr "*从第一天起就支持多云* ——AWS、Azure、GCP 和 OCI 均已涵盖，并将根据社区需求进一步扩展覆盖范围。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Native image performance** — 24 ms startup and 13 MB idle memory come directly from Quarkus native compilation via GraalVM Mandrel."
msgstr "*原生图像性能* ——24 毫秒的启动时间和 13 MB 的空闲内存，完全得益于通过 GraalVM Mandrel 实现的 Quarkus 原生编译。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Dev Services plug-in** — existing Quarkus projects can switch to Floci as the Dev Services provider with a configuration change, no SDK code changes required."
msgstr "*Dev Services 插件* ——现有 Quarkus 项目只需修改配置即可将 Dev Services 提供商切换为 Floci，无需修改 SDK 代码。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Four storage modes** — from ephemeral in-memory (ideal for AI sandboxes) to hybrid write-ahead persistence (ideal for reproducible test fixtures)."
msgstr "*四种存储模式——* 从短暂的内存存储（适用于 AI 沙箱）到混合式预写持久化（适用于可重现的测试框架）。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**AI agent isolation** — running one Floci instance per agent eliminates the risk of runaway LLM operations touching a real cloud account."
msgstr "*AI 代理隔离* ——为每个代理运行一个 Floci 实例，可消除失控的大语言模型（LLM）操作影响真实云账户的风险。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "**Looking for maintainers** — the project is growing faster than its current core team; contributors are genuinely welcome."
msgstr "*正在寻找维护者* ——该项目的增长速度已超过其当前核心团队的处理能力；我们真诚欢迎各位贡献者加入。"

msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "解决方案"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Floci is a young project that arrived at exactly the right moment: a fast, MIT-licensed, Quarkus-native replacement for a tool that tens of thousands of developers depended on. Five months in, the numbers in the issues tracker and pull request queue reflect genuine adoption, and the performance story — anchored in the same native image capabilities that gave this show some of its best benchmark conversations — gives it a strong foundation as it expands from AWS into the full multi-cloud picture. If you are interested in contributing, head to https://github.com/floci-io[github.com/floci-io] to find open issues tagged for new contributors."
msgstr "Floci 是一个崭新的项目，它恰逢其时：作为一款快速、采用 MIT 许可证、原生支持 Quarkus 的工具，它取代了此前数万名开发者所依赖的旧工具。 上线五个月以来，问题跟踪器和拉取请求队列中的数据反映出该项目已被广泛采用；其性能表现——依托于曾为本次活动带来诸多精彩基准测试讨论的原生图像处理能力——为其从 AWS 扩展至全面的多云环境奠定了坚实基础。 如果您有兴趣参与贡献，请访问 link:https://github.com/floci-io[github.com/floci-io] ，查找标记为“新贡献者”的待处理问题。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Watch the full episode on the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/quarkusio\">Quarkus YouTube channel</a>."
msgstr "请在<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/quarkusio\">Quarkus YouTube 频道</a>上观看完整剧集。"
